      "en": "Asa prayed[NOTE:1] to the Lord his God: “O Lord, there is no one but you who can help the weak when they are vastly outnumbered.[NOTE:2] Help us, O Lord our God, for we rely on you and have marched on your behalf against this huge army.[NOTE:3] O Lord, you are our God; don’t let men prevail against you!”[NOTE:4]",
